# Recommended Next Steps

1. Test the same automation in a Chromium-based browser (Chrome, Edge, or Brave) to determine whether the behavior is Firefox-specific.
2. Instead of relying on `.value`, investigate simulating real typing (character-by-character keyboard events) or using a browser automation framework that can generate trusted input events.
3. Consider bypassing the search dialog entirely by navigating directly to WhatsApp's supported URL format (for example, `https://web.whatsapp.com/send?phone=<number>`) if that fits the extension's workflow.
